# mindb 
mindb is a sql like database written in rust.

## How to use 
1. Clone the repository
```bash
git clone https://github.com/CodeMan62/mindb.git
```
2. Build the project
```bash
cargo build
```
3. Run the project 
```bash
cargo run
```
you will be able to see the repl where you can run your sql queries.

# Features
- Tokenizer
- Parser
- Pager
- Btree

